OL,3,GNEWSAMan who fractured cyclist's skull
OL,4,Ain road rage attack given supervision
OL,5,Aorder
OL,6,
OL,7,FA driver who left a cyclist with a
OL,8,Ffractured skull and bleed on the brain
OL,9,Fin a "violent and unprovoked attack"
OL,10,Fhas been given a two-year supervision
OL,11,Forder.
OL,13,FJoseph Hedley, 39, assaulted Iain
OL,14,FBrown, 34, following an altercation in
OL,15,FEdinburgh's Cowgate in September 2024.
OL,17,FHedley admitted assaulting the victim
OL,18,Fto his severe injury, permanent
OL,19,Fimpairment and to the danger of his
OL,20,Flife during an earlier appearance at
OL,21,FEdinburgh Sheriff Court.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
